    "Charging is on hold, so almost nothing is being drawn. Optimized Battery Charging or a charge limit looks exactly like this." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "充电处于暂停状态，几乎不取电。优化电池充电或充电上限就是这个样子。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Charging on hold" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "暂停充电"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Charging wirelessly. The charge IC exposes the coil's voltage but no current to pair with it, so the power coming in cannot be measured — only what reaches the cell. The figure the charger reports about itself is a ceiling, not a reading, and does not move." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "当前为无线充电。充电芯片仅提供了线圈电压，未提供对应电流，因此无法测量输入功率 —— 仅能测量充入电芯的功率。充电器自身报告的数值仅为功率上限而非实时读数，不会发生变化。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
