        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting for network samples. Unavailable readings appear as a dash." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "正在等待网络采样；无法读取时显示“—”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The power difference includes system use and conversion losses." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "功率差额包含手机自身耗电与转换损耗。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Recording pauses in the background and resumes when you return. Missed time is excluded from charge totals." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "进入后台后暂停记录，返回后继续；未采样的时间不计入充电总量。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shows traffic through the device's Wi-Fi, cellular and Ethernet interfaces, including other apps and local traffic. No speed-test downloads are performed. VPN tunnel interfaces are excluded to avoid counting the same traffic twice. 1 MB/s = 1,000,000 bytes per second." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "显示设备 Wi-Fi、蜂窝网络和以太网接口的流量，包含其他 App 和局域网通信。不发起测速下载；排除 VPN 隧道接口，避免重复统计。1 MB/s = 每秒 1,000,000 字节。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose the compact readout. Expand the Dynamic Island to see power, battery temperature and both network rates. Network monitoring also works when unplugged." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "选择灵动岛收起时显示的读数。展开后可查看功率、电池温度和上下行速率；未连接充电器时也能监测网速。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Live Activity does not keep MiniWatts running. When the app enters the background, readings are marked paused. Open MiniWatts to resume; turn this switch off and on to restart an activity you ended." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "实时活动不会让 MiniWatts 持续在后台运行。App 进入后台后，读数会标记为“已暂停”；重新打开 App 即可恢复。若手动结束了活动，可关闭再打开此开关以重新开启。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On devices without Dynamic Island, the activity appears on the Lock Screen. Widgets continue to refresh on the system's schedule." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "没有灵动岛的设备会在锁屏上显示实时活动。桌面小组件仍按系统安排刷新。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Traffic consumer" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "流量消耗器"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
