    "Connection failed (URL error %lld)." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "连接失败（URL 错误 %lld）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Automatic retries: %lld" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "自动重试：%lld 次"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reconnecting %lld download threads…" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "正在重连 %lld 个下载线程…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Received data is discarded from memory without saving a download file or disk cache. Only settings and a small progress record are saved; progress is saved once a minute and on stop." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "下载内容在内存中接收后即丢弃，不保存下载文件或磁盘缓存。仅保存设置和少量进度记录，进度每分钟及停止时保存一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Temporary connection errors retry automatically without resetting the downloaded total. Each thread retries up to 6 consecutive failures. Expired links and access errors require a new link. Background execution remains subject to system approval." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "临时网络错误会自动重试，已下载总量不会清零。每个线程连续失败最多重试 6 次。链接过期或无权限时需要更换链接；后台运行仍须系统批准。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Load + loss" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "负载与损耗"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cell share" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "电芯占比"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "cell watts ÷ measured input watts" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "电芯功率 ÷ 实测输入功率"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "hold status unknown" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "保持状态未知"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No elevated system thermal pressure." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "系统没有升高的热压力。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Warming up. iOS may trim performance or charge current." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "设备正在升温，iOS 可能降低性能或充电电流。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "High system thermal pressure. iOS may limit charge current and clocks." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "系统热压力较高，iOS 可能限制充电电流和处理器频率。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Critical thermal pressure. iOS may suspend charging until the phone cools." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "系统热压力达到临界值，iOS 可能暂停充电，直到设备冷却。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unrecognised system thermal state." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法识别的系统热状态。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "High system thermal pressure" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "系统热压力较高"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Well under the adapter's rating while system thermal pressure is high. Charge current may be limited by iOS." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "系统热压力较高时，功率明显低于充电器额定值。iOS 可能限制了充电电流。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Charge power below the adapter's rating right now is expected: system thermal pressure may be limiting current." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "当前充电功率低于适配器额定值是正常的：系统热压力可能正在限制电流。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The input sensors read %@ W while %@ W is reaching the cell, so on this model they see only part of what comes in. That figure is not shown as the input, and nothing is worked out from it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "输入传感器读数为 %1$@ W，而进入电芯的有 %2$@ W，说明在这个机型上它们只测到了部分输入。这个数值不会作为输入功率显示，也不会据此推算任何结果。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sensor names and scales differ by iPhone model, and this build was checked on an iPhone Air. Impossible readings stay in Raw data but are left out of derived temperatures; a reading that is merely wrong cannot be spotted that way — if something here looks off for your model, it may well be." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "传感器的名称和换算方式因 iPhone 机型而异，这个版本是在 iPhone Air 上验证的。不可能的读数仍保留在原始数据里，但不参与推算出的温度；只是错、却还说得过去的读数拦不住——如果这里有哪个数字在你的机型上看着不对，很可能就是不对。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Excluded from derived temperatures" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "未计入推算温度的读数"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Temperature sensors answered, but every value was excluded from derived readings. See the filter details below." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "温度传感器有响应，但所有数值都被排除在推算读数之外。详见下方的过滤说明。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Measured at the phone's USB-C rail (VQ0u × IQ0u). The adapter value is a negotiated ceiling, not a wall-meter reading." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在手机 USB-C 供电轨上测得（VQ0u × IQ0u）。适配器的数值是协商出的上限，不是功率计的读数。"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version" : "1.0"
}
